        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Yes. All our hi-vis workwear is manufactured to meet EN ISO 20471 standards. This includes proper reflective tape placement, background material requirements, and photometric performance specifications.</p>
