        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">We provide reflective tape in various widths and performance levels. All reflective tape meets EN ISO 20471 standards for retroreflection. Options include glass bead tape and microprismatic tape.</p>
      </div>
